---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Image Identifier — a free browser tool to check if an image looks AI-generated or real."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-fg m-0">About</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Image Identifier is a free tool that helps you check whether a photo looks AI-generated or
      real. Results are estimates and can be wrong — not legal proof.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
      The check runs in your browser on the file you choose. Your image is not uploaded to our
      servers. The site may still load app assets over the network.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Open the <a href="/">tool</a> to try a file.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-muted">
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      <span class="mx-2">·</span>
      <a href="/">Back to the tool</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
